# Optional. Without this, the build still works, but GitHub's API is capped
# at 60 unauthenticated requests/hour (shared across whatever else uses your
# network), which repeated builds can burn through.
#
# To raise it to 5000/hour:
# 1. github.com -> Settings -> Developer settings -> Personal access tokens -> Tokens (classic)
# 2. Generate one with no scopes selected (public repo read access doesn't need any)
# 3. Paste it below for local dev, and add it as an env var named GITHUB_TOKEN
#    in your Vercel project settings for deploys.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
